    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to No. 181 Ardilaun a fantastic 4 bedroom semi-detached home offering highly adaptable living spaces ideal for the evolving needs of a growing family. Ideally situated in a family friendly estate in a quiet cul de sac next to large open green space.\r\n\r\nThe interior comprises a front porch into an inviting entrance hall, spacious lounge with interconnecting doors to dining room, a well-appointed kitchen, rear extension for family area or kids’ room and utility room with guest w/c. On the first floor there are 4 generously sized bedrooms with master ensuite and a family bathroom. The property is enhanced by a fully walled rear garden overlooking playing fields and a front garage ideal for storage.\r\n\r\nArdilaun estate is well-suited for families, featuring an array of expansive open green areas providing year-round enjoyment for children. Conveniently located near Portmarnock Village, residents can access a range of amenities, including schools, shops, cafes, and Portmarnock Beach. Reliable public transport connections to and from Dublin City Centre, while Dublin Airport, the M1, and M50 motorways are in close proximity"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch\t2.0 x 1.30\tTiled floor, sliding door\r\n\r\nHall\t5.33 x 1.22\tDecorative timber floor\r\n\r\nLiving room\t5.30 x 3.45\tDecorative timber floor, open fire, 2 x wall lights, dual aspect\r\n\r\nDining Room\t4.10 x 2.77\tDecorative timber floor, centrepiece, coving\r\n\t\t\r\nKitchen\t5.10 x 2.26\tTiled floor, fully fitted kitchen, hob, extractor fan, fridge freezer, dishwasher, washing machine\r\n\t\t\r\nUtility\t3.35 x 2.40\tCoat rack, fitted units, freezer, plumbed for washer/dryer, door to garage \r\n\r\nGarage/WC\t2.40 x 2.10\tWc, Whb\r\n\r\nStairs / landing\t\tAccess to attic, hot press\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\t1.90 x 1.85\t\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\t2.86 x 2.54\tFitted wardrobes, decorative timber floor, top light\r\n\t\t\r\nMaster Bedroom\t4.35 x 3.10\tMirrored slide wardrobes, \r\nEnsuite\t2.0 x 1.75\tPart tiled walls, w.h.b., shower,\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 3\t4.15 x 2.75\tMirrored slide wardrobes, decorative timber floor\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 4\t2.85 x2.80\tDecorative timber floor\r\n\r\nFront Garden\tPaved driveway, off street parking, mature trees and shrubs\r\n\r\nRear Garden\tLawn, part patio, tap, fully walled, overlooking large playing fields"
      },
      {
